# The Redshift plug's client side, for episode images built with
# `--warehouse-clients redshift` (Dockerfile ALKERA_WAREHOUSE_CLIENTS): the
# AWS Python driver and the dbt adapter (which connects through it). psql is
# the toolbelt's postgresql-client. Compiled here, NOT in pyproject/uv.lock,
# like every backend's clients (docker/lock_warehouse_clients.py): constrained
# to the base, native and ds locks, so every package it shares with them is
# the same version; certifi is the one deliberate exception
# (redshift-clients.overrides). Regenerate with the command in
# requirements-redshift.lock's header.
